{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity","kind":"lemma","title":"Frobenius dagger forces $G \\subseteq \\mathrm{U}(2)$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-fiber-adjoint-involution","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-positive-definite-dagger"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity"],"tags":["frobenius","dagger","unitarity","u2"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.su2_emergence_dagger_unitarity","text":"su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity\"></a><p>Every tensor automorphism <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">g \\in G</code> preserves the Frobenius dagger structure on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau(V)</code>. Consequently, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G \\subseteq \\mathrm{U}(2)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"3.2.7"}
